{"parents": [{"link": "../../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../../", "title": "auth_server"}, {"link": "../", "title": "auth_server.anonymous"}], "prev": {"link": "../client/", "title": "auth_server.anonymous.client"}, "next": {"link": "../../mfa_client/", "title": "auth_server.mfa_client"}, "title": "auth_server.anonymous.helpers", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth_server.anonymous.helpers\">\n<span id=\"auth-server-anonymous-helpers\"></span><h1>auth_server.anonymous.helpers<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth_server.anonymous.helpers\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Pure helper functions for anonymous session operations.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Import</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">auth0_server_python.auth_server.anonymous.helpers</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">decode_anonymous_sub</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">find_token_set</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">map_anonymous_error</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">normalize_url</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parse_anonymous_error_body</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">upsert_token_set</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">validate_metadata</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.anonymous.helpers.decode_anonymous_sub\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">decode_anonymous_sub</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/auth_server/anonymous/helpers.py#L52\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.decode_anonymous_sub\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Extract the sub claim from a JWT access token without verifying the signature.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 The token to decode.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The sub claim, or None for opaque tokens, non-JWT strings, or\ntokens with no sub claim.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.anonymous.helpers.find_token_set\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">find_token_set</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">token_sets</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">audience</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">scope</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../auth_types/#auth_types.AnonymousTokenSetEntry\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousTokenSetEntry\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.AnonymousTokenSetEntry</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/auth_server/anonymous/helpers.py#L76\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.find_token_set\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the cached token set for an audience/scope pair, or None.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.anonymous.helpers.map_anonymous_error\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">map_anonymous_error</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">error_data</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">operation</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/exceptions.html#Exception\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">Exception</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/auth_server/anonymous/helpers.py#L122\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.map_anonymous_error\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Map a server error response to a typed exception.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>error_data</strong> \u2013 The parsed error response body.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>operation</strong> \u2013 One of \u2018create\u2019, \u2018token\u2019.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The exception instance. Does not raise it.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.anonymous.helpers.normalize_url\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">normalize_url</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/auth_server/anonymous/helpers.py#L30\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.normalize_url\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Normalize a domain-like value for comparison.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>value</strong> \u2013 A domain or URL string, or None.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The value lowercased, scheme-qualified, and without a trailing\nslash. Falsy input is returned unchanged.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.anonymous.helpers.parse_anonymous_error_body\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">parse_anonymous_error_body</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">response</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">httpx.Response</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/auth_server/anonymous/helpers.py#L101\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.parse_anonymous_error_body\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Parse an error response body as JSON.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>response</strong> \u2013 The HTTP response to parse.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The parsed JSON body, or a fallback dict with \u2018error_description\u2019\nwhen the body is not valid JSON.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.anonymous.helpers.upsert_token_set\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">upsert_token_set</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">context</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../auth_types/#auth_types.AnonymousSessionContext\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousSessionContext\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.AnonymousSessionContext</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">entry</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../auth_types/#auth_types.AnonymousTokenSetEntry\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousTokenSetEntry\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.AnonymousTokenSetEntry</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../auth_types/#auth_types.AnonymousSessionContext\" title=\"auth_types.AnonymousSessionContext\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.AnonymousSessionContext</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/auth_server/anonymous/helpers.py#L88\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.upsert_token_set\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return a copy of context with the token set for entry\u2019s audience/scope replaced.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py function\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.anonymous.helpers.validate_metadata\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate_metadata</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">metadata</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.15)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/auth0-server-python/blob/main/src/auth0_server_python/auth_server/anonymous/helpers.py#L148\"><span class=\"viewcode-link\"><span class=\"pre\">[source]</span></span></a><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.validate_metadata\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Validate metadata locally before it reaches the network.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>metadata</strong> \u2013 The metadata dict to validate, or None.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../../error/#error.AnonymousSessionCreateError\" title=\"error.AnonymousSessionCreateError\"><strong>AnonymousSessionCreateError</strong></a> \u2013 metadata is not a dict, contains a\na non-JSON-serializable value, or exceeds 1KB.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.anonymous.helpers.ANON_IDENTIFIER\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ANON_IDENTIFIER</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'_a0_anon'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.ANON_IDENTIFIER\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.anonymous.helpers.TRANSFER_AUDIENCE\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">TRANSFER_AUDIENCE</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'urn:auth0:anon_transfer'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.TRANSFER_AUDIENCE\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth_server/mfa_client/index", "auth_server.mfa_client", "N", "next"], ["reference/auth_server/anonymous/client/index", "auth_server.anonymous.client", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/auth_server/anonymous/helpers/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">auth_server.anonymous.helpers</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.decode_anonymous_sub\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">decode_anonymous_sub()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.find_token_set\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">find_token_set()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.map_anonymous_error\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">map_anonymous_error()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.normalize_url\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">normalize_url()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.parse_anonymous_error_body\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">parse_anonymous_error_body()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.upsert_token_set\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">upsert_token_set()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.validate_metadata\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">validate_metadata()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.ANON_IDENTIFIER\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ANON_IDENTIFIER</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.anonymous.helpers.TRANSFER_AUDIENCE\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TRANSFER_AUDIENCE</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "reference/auth_server/anonymous/helpers/index", "sidebars": ["about.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "searchbox.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "0.7.16", "alabaster_version_info": [0, 7, 16]}